; What "good" means for the cube. Objectives are reviewed by a person (game-stacks.md §9):
; an agent proposes changes to this file by pull request, never with the data it judges.
(objective cube.turns
   (desc "Twenty seconds of spinning make 2 to 10 full turns: visible, not a blur")
   (measure {cube.turns})
   (pass {2 <= $value <= 10}))
